          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "SEBI Orders Immediate Cybersecurity Overhaul Across All Regulated Entities, Citing Claude Mythos Risks",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "India's Securities and Exchange Board of India has issued a formal cybersecurity circular naming Anthropic's Claude Mythos AI system as a specific threat, ordering every regulated financial entity to urgently strengthen its cyber defences. SEBI has also formed a dedicated task force to oversee the overhaul. This is the first time SEBI has named a specific AI capability in a regulatory circular, marking a significant escalation in how Indian financial regulators treat advanced AI as a systemic risk.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-sebi-claude-mythos-circular-orders-cybersecurity-overhaul/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
